{"_t":"finding","entity":"GISNET V5 by Complot (multi-city GIS template)","field":"auth","value":"web viewer itself is auth-free/public, but underlying data API is not exposed for direct programmatic access (server-side proxy only, ASP.NET MVC endpoints like ~/Export/GetCount, ~/Export/ExportOnlyExcel)","source_key":"v5.gis-net.co.il/v5/netanya"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GISNET V5 by Complot (multi-city GIS template)","field":"cost","value":"unknown - commercial municipal GIS contract, not a public API product","source_key":"v5.gis-net.co.il/v5/netanya"}
